# EAS Build archives from the ROOT of this git repository, not from
# mobile-expo/ -- this is a monorepo (site/, portal/, mobile-expo/, etc
# all live side by side), and without this file EAS uploads the entire
# repo on every build (site/ ~24MB, the legacy mobile/ folder ~5MB,
# portal/ ~3.6MB, dozens of report .md files at the root, ...) even
# though none of it is needed to build the iOS/Android app. That's why
# "Compressing project files" was reporting ~65MB instead of the ~20MB
# mobile-expo/ actually needs.
#
# IMPORTANT: creating this file makes EAS ignore every .gitignore in the
# repo entirely (root's and mobile-expo/'s) -- so their real exclusions
# (secrets, caches, stale build output) are folded in below rather than
# just the monorepo-trim exclusions. See root .gitignore and
# mobile-expo/.gitignore for the source of truth these mirror.
#
# mobile-expo/ needs one thing outside itself: shared/mobile-dto/ (the
# wire-contract types, see mobile-expo/metro.config.js's own comment on
# why it lives at the repo root) -- shared/ is intentionally NOT ignored
# here.

# --- Unrelated top-level packages/content (monorepo trim) ---
/site/
/portal/
/mobile/
/design-system/
/group/
/test/
/.claude/
/.design-sync/
/*.md
/*.sql

# --- mobile-expo/: secrets (mirrors mobile-expo/.gitignore) ---
mobile-expo/.env
mobile-expo/.env.local
mobile-expo/.env.*.local
mobile-expo/*.jks
mobile-expo/*.p8
mobile-expo/*.p12
mobile-expo/*.key
mobile-expo/*.mobileprovision
mobile-expo/*.pem

# --- mobile-expo/: caches/generated/stale build output ---
mobile-expo/node_modules/
mobile-expo/.expo/
mobile-expo/dist/
mobile-expo/web-build/
mobile-expo/expo-env.d.ts
mobile-expo/.kotlin/
mobile-expo/*.orig.*
mobile-expo/.metro-health-check*
mobile-expo/npm-debug.*
mobile-expo/yarn-debug.*
mobile-expo/yarn-error.*
mobile-expo/.DS_Store
mobile-expo/*.tsbuildinfo
mobile-expo/ios/
mobile-expo/android/

# --- root-level secrets/caches (mirrors root .gitignore) ---
node_modules/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
